From: retropineaple <118107729+retropineaple@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:43:03 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 01/54] Capture ADL-P firmware eDP state in -wex-adlp-readout

Record transcoder/PPS/backlight/PSR/PLL/Combo PHY A registers, the VBT
and sink DPCD (native AUX reads on an idle, powered AUX A) so Display13
eDP bring-up can be designed from real firmware state.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
